+Added one `@conformance` scenario to `features/conformance/dom-identity.feature`:
+- "The event binding helper passes the useCapture flag to addEventListener"
 
-Updated `cucumber.js` conformance profile tag from `'@captain and @conformance'` to `'@conformance'`.
+This scenario detects when the `on()` helper calls `addEventListener` with only 2 arguments (event, handler) instead of 3 (event, handler, capture).
 
